# ── Signing and secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This project is code-signed, so certificates and provisioning assets are the
# most damaging thing that could land here by accident.
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.pem
*.key
ExportOptions.plist
.env
.env.*

# ── Device credentials ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A pairing file is enough for anything holding it to talk to that iPhone, and the
# developer disk image is Apple's software rather than this project's. Both are produced
# by scripts/prepare-phone.sh, which writes them to the Desktop precisely so they cannot
# be committed by accident — these patterns are the second line.
pairing.plist
*.mobiledevicepairing
*.trustcache
BuildManifest.plist
Image.dmg
Mirage Setup/
marker.json
device-check.json

# ── Generated Xcode projects ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ios/Mirage.xcodeproj is written by scripts/gen-xcodeproj.sh from ios/project.yml. It is
# a pile of UUIDs that conflicts on every merge, and — the part that matters — it carries
# whoever generated it: Xcode writes DEVELOPMENT_TEAM into project.pbxproj, and names the
# per-user folders after the account. Every .xcodeproj here is generated, so none of them
# belong in the repository.
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xcuserstate

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
DerivedData/
.build/
.swiftpm/
target/
*.egg-info/
dist/

# ── Environments and caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Mirage runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Normally in ~/Library/Application Support/Mirage, but MIRAGE_STATE_DIR can point
# anywhere — including here during development. These hold saved locations, a consent
# record and a device fingerprint, and must never be committed.
consent.json
simulation.json
trips.json
device-salt
control.sock
*.log
*.tmp

# ── Editors and OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
